{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978770/extras/e9e30800d0cd51fe1f37b0969a2c4ffc.poster.avif?t=1758040544\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978770/extras/e9e30800d0cd51fe1f37b0969a2c4ffc.webm?t=1758040544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978770/extras/e9e30800d0cd51fe1f37b0969a2c4ffc.mp4?t=1758040544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Hats and Guns is a roguelite deckbuilder set in the Wild West. Play as different characters with unique gameplays. Upgrade your cards and collect powerful weapons and relics as you attempt to survive in the heart of a dangerous procedurally-generated desert.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo Content</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical combat<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978770/extras/1610aa913518cbaf9ea2366f009dbfcd.poster.avif?t=1758040544\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978770/extras/1610aa913518cbaf9ea2366f009dbfcd.webm?t=1758040544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978770/extras/1610aa913518cbaf9ea2366f009dbfcd.mp4?t=1758040544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Battles take place on a grid, with accuracy as the central system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Here, accuracy doesn\u2019t determine a chance to hit the target, but rather the amount of damage dealt. No room for randomness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Around twenty levels, randomly selected for each run, are available in this demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 5 enemies, each equipped with a different weapon, provide diverse challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deckbuilding <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978770/extras/e4cc3fde003a62e340e6080a7f0a6f2c.poster.avif?t=1758040544\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978770/extras/e4cc3fde003a62e340e6080a7f0a6f2c.webm?t=1758040544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978770/extras/e4cc3fde003a62e340e6080a7f0a6f2c.mp4?t=1758040544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Discover around fifteen card upgrades to assign to your 5 types of base cards. Optimize your deck and try to create powerful combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 playable characters <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978770/extras/9f8e64c349d53337709976a7b8a8018e.avif?t=1758040544\" width=600 height=280 /></span>Two characters with very different playstyles are available in this demo. Each one has a unique starting deck and different weapons, offering unique gameplay situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural desert and rewards<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978770/extras/f137ca2e14e684409e55c3764fe42cff.poster.avif?t=1758040544\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978770/extras/f137ca2e14e684409e55c3764fe42cff.webm?t=1758040544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978770/extras/f137ca2e14e684409e55c3764fe42cff.mp4?t=1758040544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Venture into the heart of the desert by carefully choosing your path.<br> Available in the demo:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural map generation for replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 random events offering reward choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around ten consumables, single-use items with varied effects.</p></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3978770?t=1758040544","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3978770?t=1758040544","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978770/39ff31aa646288f2e9ca5be69e5de1ba20043d52/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758040544","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978770/39ff31aa646288f2e9ca5be69e5de1ba20043d52/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758040544","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978770/extras/e9e30800d0cd51fe1f37b0969a2c4ffc.poster.avif?t=1758040544\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978770/extras/e9e30800d0cd51fe1f37b0969a2c4ffc.webm?t=1758040544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse